Vault CSI Driver – Ideal when using Vault directly; but our system uses a custom KMS.
Kubernetes External Secrets (KES) – Our implementation is conceptually similar: CRD + controller + periodic sync. However, ours is customized for KMS logic and integrates directly with specific deployment targets.


